 you don’t want to ask yourfriends (or ChatGPT)? Tired of professionals 
 trying to sell you investment services or insurance in the name of 
 ‘advice’?\n\nJoin us for a judgement-free hour with Certified Financial 
 PlannersTM from Old Peak Finance for a short presentation followed by open 
 Q&A. Coffee & snacks provided! This even is free and open to the public. 
 Registration is appreciated but not required.\n\nQuestions? Please email 
