SUMMARY:Get Set\, Get Ready\, Let's Read: Talkers Edition
DESCRIPTION:Ms. Patty & Ms. Sara are here to help prepare your Talker (kids 
 ages 2-3) as they begin the process of learning to read. Structured similar 
 to storytimes\, we will teach parents how to help their toddler learn 
 important pre-reading skills that can dramatically increase language 
 development. Classes are held on Monday\, June 8th and Monday\, June 29th 
 at 11:00am at the East Regional Library. You only need to attend one class. 
 \n\nEach child will receive a bag filled with early literacy tools to use 
 at home as they continue the path to becoming a reader. \n\nFor children 
 ages 2-3 years old. To help us manage space\, please register only the 
 child participating in the storytime. Adults are not counted in 
 registration.\n\nThis initiative is made possible from the generous support 
 of the Durham Library Foundation.
