 Pigs\, Oh My!" while we diamond paint dinosaur figurines! \n\nAll 
 supplies\, including coffee and tea\, will be provided. \n\nRegistration is 
 required\, as supplies are limited. We will meet in the small meeting room 
 of the North Regional Library\, 221 Milton Rd.
