 songs\, games\, and other fun activities!  While content is geared toward 
 preschoolers (ages 3-5 years)\, all are welcome to join in on the fun! The 
 program runs for about 25 minutes\, and families are invited to stay 
 afterward for open play and socialization time.\n\nTo celebrate 2026 Summer 
 Reading and its theme\, "Unearth a Story\," we will be focusing on 
 dinosaurs from June 10 - August 5\, 2026.\n\nThis program has a mix of 
 sensory elements\, some high energy (e.g. singing and moving) and some low 
 energy (e.g. listening quietly to stories). \n\nIf you have any 
 accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please email Molly at 
 mschaefer@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests be made at least three (3) 
