SUMMARY:POSTPONED -- Dino Dig Zen Gardens for Teens
DESCRIPTION:THIS EVENT HAS BEEN POSTPONED. Keep an eye out for a 
 rescheduled session of this exciting event!\n\nChoose from a selection of 
 genuine fossils\, rocks\, and gems to arrange\, bury\, uncover\, and bury 
 again in a mini Zen Garden inspired by fossil digs! You'll also get the 
 chance to learn and share about famous archeological dig sites\, as well as 
 how Zen Gardens promote mindfulness!\n\nFor participants ages 12-18.\n\nDue 
 to limited supplies\, registration is required. Please reach out to Ezra\, 
 South Regional's Teen Librarian\, at eletson@dconc.gov with any questions!
