SUMMARY:Game Day for Grown-Ups!
DESCRIPTION:Keep socially active while learning new games! Members are 
 welcome to play one of our board games or bring one from home. We love 
 learning new games and new strategies for old games in a fun\, 
 non-competitive environment! \n\nThis program will take place at the North 
 Regional Library\, 221 Milton Rd\, in the large meeting room. Email 
 dpeterson@dconc.gov with questions or accommodation needs.
LOCATION:North Regional - Children's Programming Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Desiree Peterson":MAILTO:dpeterson@dconc.gov
