SUMMARY:Dinosaur Duel: Melee in the Mesozoic!
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're the Iguanadons biggest fan or a die hard T-Rex 
 supporter\, vote for your favorite dinosaurs in our March-Madness style 
 showdown. Be sure to vote every week for your favorites! Each time you vote 
 you earn a chance to win a Dinosaur Mini Tote Bag filled with 
 snacks!\n\nVote in person at South Regional Library or online! Brackets 
 will be updated every Monday. \n
