 Media\n	Information Literacy\n	Career Search Skills\n	Your Digital 
 Footprint\n	Accessing Telehealth Appointments\n	Cybersecurity Basics\n\n\n 
 \n\nLaptops will be provided\, but participants are welcome to use their 
 own computers. Attendees are encouraged to bring headphones.
