SUMMARY:Preschool Storytime
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Fridays for Preschool Storytime! Designed for 
 children ages 3–5\, this interactive storytime includes books\, songs\, 
 movement\, and a simple craft or coloring activity\, though children of all 
 ages are welcome to attend. Registration is encouraged to help us prepare 
 enough craft materials.\n\nPreschool Storytime will be led by Children’s 
 Librarians Tina and Miles. See below for the schedule of 
 presenters:\n\n\n	Friday\, June 5 – Tina\n	Friday\, June 12 – 
 Tina\n	Friday\, June 26 – Miles\n	Friday\, July 10 – Miles\n	Friday\, 
 July 17 – Tina\n	Friday\, July 24 – Miles\n	Friday\, July 31 – 
 Tina\n	Friday\, August 7 – Tina\n	Friday\, August 14 – Miles\n	Friday\, 
 August 21 – Tina\n	Friday\, August 28 – Miles\n\n
