SUMMARY:Outlining for Authors (Plot Workshop)
DESCRIPTION:Outlining for Authors will walk you through developing and 
 using premise and story structure to create a functional outline that will 
 keep you on track while writing your story. If you're an author in the 
 planning stages of your next fictional work\, this workshop can help frame 
 how you think about the writing process and keep the story moving. Even if 
 you've already begun\, you can use some of the tools discussed in this 
 workshop to help in the revision process.
