SUMMARY:Tea-Rex Party
DESCRIPTION:Step into a prehistoric party like no other! Join us for an 
 intergenerational Dinosaur Tea Party where dino lovers of all ages can 
 gather for a roaring good time. Enjoy tasty snacks and tea (or juice!)\, 
 while surrounded by fun dinosaur-themed décor. Get creative with coloring 
 pages\, explore engaging activity sheets\, and share stories and laughter 
 across generations. Whether you’re a tiny triceratops or a wise old 
 stegosaurus\, this delightful program is the perfect way to connect\, 
 create\, and celebrate together.\n\nRegistration is required! Please 
 register everyone who will be attending this event! \n\nIf you have any 
 accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please contact us at 
 cromero@dconc.gov or againes@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests be made at 
 least three (3) business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide 
 the best accommodations possible!\n\nThis program will be held on July 11\, 
 2026\, at 12:00 p.m. at North Regional Library. The address is 221 Milton 
 Rd. Durham\, NC 27712.
LOCATION:North Meeting Room - Full Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
