SUMMARY:Baby-sitters Club Book Club @ Southwest
DESCRIPTION:Join Southwest's Baby-sitters Club Book Club! Each month\, 
 we'll discuss a book from the graphic novel series and do a fun activity. 
 Open to ages 7-12. \n\nSome copies will be available at the Children's Desk 
 on a first come first served basis. Interested in a digital copy? Check one 
