 kstockdale@dconc.gov or call (919) 560-8592. \n\n\nMay: Dawn on the Coast 
 \n\nNote: Based on the vote results from April's book club meeting\, we 
 will begin reading the Baby-sitters Little Sister series\, part of the BSC 
 universe\, in June! \n\nJune: Baby-sitters Little Sister: Karen's Witch 
