DESCRIPTION:Let your builder's brain explore in our Lego Club!  Join us to 
 make your creation and have it displayed in the library until our next 
 meeting.  Drop in and build with us! Children age 10 and under are to be 
 supervised and must remain in the physical presence of the parent\, legal 
 guardian\, or caregiver.\n\nThis program will be held on July 14\, 2026\, 
 at 4: 00p.m at North Regional Library. The address is 221 Milton Rd. 
 Durham\, NC 27712. \n\nIf you have any accessibility questions or 
