SUMMARY:Homeschool Learning Lab: Eno River State Park Visit
DESCRIPTION:Take a field trip to Eno River State Park with Homeschool 
 Learning Lab. Learn about waterbugs with a park ranger. This event will be 
 held at 10a.m. on Thursday\, July 16\, 2026.  The address is 6101 Cole Mill 
 Rd\, Durham\, NC 27705\n\nPlease wear clothes you don't mind getting wet 
 and closed toed shoes.\n\nHomeschool Learning Lab meets weekly year-round. 
 In the summer\, we ask for registration in order to help with program prep. 
 Please register each child attending. \n\nIf you have any questions\, 
 accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please contact Molly at 
 mschaefer@dconc.gov.  We ask that all requests be made at least three (3) 
 business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide the best 
 accommodations possible! More information to follow via email. \n\n
LOCATION:Offsite
