DESCRIPTION:Join the Maker   STEAM Team in the Innovation Lab during 
 specified open hours to explore cardboard construction with Makedo kits! 
 Engineer new creations with reusable materials and tools safe for all ages. 
 \n\nThis is a self-paced activity. You can drop in during the listed Open 
 Lab Hours.\n\nInnovation Lab Open Hours:\n\nMonday: Closed\nTuesday: 1pm - 
 5pm\nWednesday: closed (*different this week)\nThursday: 10am - 
 2pm\nFriday: 1pm - 5pm\nSaturday: 11am - 1pm and 3pm - 5pm\n\nHours subject 
