SUMMARY:CRAFT-tastic Creations: Make Your Own Paper Bowl Jellyfish!
DESCRIPTION:To all youths ages 6-11 years and their caregivers: join Ms. 
 Natalie for a CRAFT-tastic time! Every third Thursday of the month\, we 
 will get creative and do some crafting together!\n\nThis month\, we will 
 make our own paper bowl jellyfishes using curling ribbon\, googly eyes\, 
 paper bowls\, tissue paper\, yarn\, glue\, tape\, and scissors! 
 \n\nRegistration is required.\n\nIf you have any questions\, please contact 
 us @ 919-560-8592.
LOCATION:Southwest Regional - Children's Programming Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Natalie Perez":MAILTO:natperez@dconc.gov
