SUMMARY:Welcome to "The Labyrinthosaurus!"
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an adventure! \n\nCome and explore the Dino 
 Labyrinth where dinosaurs could be larger than life or not what you 
 expected. See if you can find your way out!\n\nTwists and turns around 
 every corner along with surprises to uncover. What will you find as you 
 unearth your story? \n\nThis program is part of our Summer Reading Theme\, 
 "Unearth Your Story"\, where every path leads to a new adventure! 
 \n\n\n\nIf you have questions or need accommodations for this event\, 
 please contact Ms. Patty at (919) 560-0172 with questions and it’s all 
 indoors.\n\nFree Library Event for All Ages. No Registration Required! 
