SUMMARY:CANCELLED - Page Turners Club
DESCRIPTION:CANCELLED - We will meet again next week 7/28.\nPage Turners 
 Club is a fun and engaging summer reading program for rising 2nd and 3rd 
 graders. Join us every Tuesday and Thursday this summer as we explore 
 exciting stories\, build reading confidence\, and discover the joy of books 
 through read-alouds\, activities\, games\, and prizes. Whether your child 
 already loves reading or is just beginning their reading journey\, Page 
 Turners Club is a welcoming space to grow imagination\, friendship\, and a 
 lifelong love of reading.\n\nSnacks will be provided!\n\nRegistration is 
 required!
