SUMMARY:Dino Explorers!
DESCRIPTION:Stomp on over to Rock Quarry Park and join Ms. Sara and Ms. 
 Patty from  Family Literacy & Community Engagement Services 
 because\,\n\n“We’re going on a DINO HUNT!" Let's explore\, play and see 
 if we can spy some dinosaurs.\n\n(Rock Quarry Park located at 701 Stadium 
