SUMMARY:Sew Summer: Time to Cook!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for three days of sewing fun this summer. All materials 
 will be provided! You can bring your own fabric if you prefer. Experienced 
 sewers will have the opportunity to make up to three projects. We will make 
 an apron\, an oversized hot pad\, and a reuseable microwave popcorn bag. 
 New and less experience sewers are welcome and will begin with the basics\, 
 before choosing from one of the larger projects listed. \n\nThis is a 
 series of classes over three days and we are hoping participants will 
 attend for all three days as projects may overlap days.\n\nPlease feel free 
 to bring a bagged lunch\, drink\, and/or snack. Light refreshments\, such 
 as chips\, will be provided.\n\nFor teens and tweens\, ages 9 and up! 
 Registration is required!
